    <briefdescription>
<para>Fades the oldest items of a series, like the trace of an oscilloscope. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Items are ordered by index: the first item is the oldest. The oldest <computeroutput>length</computeroutput> share of the items fades from <computeroutput>minOpacity</computeroutput> at the first item to full opacity, along <computeroutput>easing</computeroutput>; the newer items are drawn as usual. Supported by <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref></computeroutput>, line and markers, and <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1PointCloud" kindref="compound">PointCloud</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SeriesEffect" kindref="compound">SeriesEffect</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1Glow" kindref="compound">Glow</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
